  "alltext": "17.\nBHANU\nThesko..malli prodhunavaraku room\nki osthey adugu\nVEDA looks at the clock, which shows 5:00 a.m.\nVEDA\nRey idhi..idhi..naa card raa...nee\ndhaggarikela vachindhi?\nBHANU\n(pissed)\nMorning I borrowed it\nVEDA\nAdigi theskunte borrow\nraa..adakkunda thiskunte\ndhobbeyadam antaruu\nBHANU\nEdichav..bodi card. Okka party ke\nlimit challe.\nVEDA\nRey..limit 30 veluraa!!\nFREEZE FRAME\nNARRATOR (V.O.)\nIthanu oo pedda software\nengineer...\n(sarcastically)\nokappudu. Ippudu paedha software\nengineer. Yeppatiki bench meeda\nvundalanukunnaadu.. Kaani company\nbenche laagesindi..anthey. Aa\nbhadhalonchi therukune lopu\nkudhirina pelli cancel ayyindhi.\nNARRATOR (V.O.)\nPelli kudhirindhanna santhosham lo\npartylu, shoppinglu antu cardulu\nviparithanga geekadu..appula\nbaadha, recovery agents gola\nperigipoyindhi, dhaaniki thodu\nthagubothu roommate dorikina\ndabbulu dorikinattu\nethukelthaadu..ippudu karchulaki\ndabbulu levu, gikadaaniki cardulu\nlevu, by the way..peru Veda\nShankar.\nCUT TO:",
